%%{init: {'theme':'base', 'themeVariables': {'primaryColor':'#1e40af','primaryTextColor':'#fff','primaryBorderColor':'#3b82f6','lineColor':'#6366f1','secondaryColor':'#059669','tertiaryColor':'#dc2626'}}}%%
graph TD
    Start([Payment Issue Reported]) --> CheckSymptom{What's the symptom?}

    CheckSymptom -->|Invoice won't create| InvoiceIssues[Section 1: Invoice Creation]
    CheckSymptom -->|Payment stuck pending| VerificationIssues[Section 2: Verification]
    CheckSymptom -->|Webhook not received| WebhookIssues[Section 3: Webhooks]
    CheckSymptom -->|Payment keeps retrying| RetryIssues[Section 4: Retry Logic]
    CheckSymptom -->|Invalid state error| StateMachineIssues[Section 5: State Machine]
    CheckSymptom -->|System slow| PerformanceIssues[Section 6: Performance]

    InvoiceIssues --> CheckNode{Is Lightning<br/>node healthy?}
    CheckNode -->|No| RestartNode[Restart LND Node<br/>Wait for sync]
    CheckNode -->|Yes| CheckAmount{Is amount valid?}
    CheckAmount -->|No| FixAmount[Update amount<br/>validation rules]
    CheckAmount -->|Yes| CheckLiquidity{Sufficient<br/>inbound liquidity?}
    CheckLiquidity -->|No| AddLiquidity[Open new channels<br/>or rebalance]
    CheckLiquidity -->|Yes| CheckAPI{API responding?}

    VerificationIssues --> CheckActual{What does LND<br/>say about payment?}
    CheckActual -->|Settled| ManualUpdate[Manual DB update<br/>Mark completed]
    CheckActual -->|Failed/Expired| MarkFailed[Update to failed<br/>Notify user]
    CheckActual -->|Still pending| CheckWebhook{Was webhook<br/>received?}
    CheckWebhook -->|No| WebhookMissing[Check webhook<br/>delivery logs]
    CheckWebhook -->|Yes| CheckLock{Database<br/>locked?}

    WebhookIssues --> CheckSig{Signature<br/>verification failing?}
    CheckSig -->|Yes| CheckSecret{Is webhook<br/>secret correct?}
    CheckSecret -->|No| UpdateSecret[Update webhook<br/>secret from provider]
    CheckSecret -->|Yes| CheckTimestamp{Timestamp<br/>within tolerance?}
    CheckTimestamp -->|No| SyncTime[Sync server time<br/>with NTP]
    CheckSig -->|No| CheckDuplicate{Duplicate<br/>webhooks?}
    CheckDuplicate -->|Yes| ImplementIdempotency[Implement idempotency<br/>key tracking]

    RetryIssues --> CheckCircuit{Circuit breaker<br/>open?}
    CheckCircuit -->|Yes| CheckNodeHealth{Is LND<br/>healthy now?}
    CheckNodeHealth -->|Yes| ResetCircuit[Manually reset<br/>circuit breaker]
    CheckNodeHealth -->|No| WaitNode[Fix LND issue<br/>first]
    CheckCircuit -->|No| CheckMaxRetries{Max retries<br/>exceeded?}
    CheckMaxRetries -->|Yes| CheckPaymentStatus{Check actual<br/>payment status}
    CheckMaxRetries -->|No| CheckBackoff{Backoff<br/>too slow?}

    StateMachineIssues --> CheckTransition{What transition<br/>was rejected?}
    CheckTransition --> VerifyRules[Review state<br/>transition rules]
    VerifyRules --> CheckConcurrent{Concurrent<br/>updates?}
    CheckConcurrent -->|Yes| ImplementLocking[Implement optimistic<br/>locking with versions]
    CheckConcurrent -->|No| CheckStuck{Payment stuck<br/>in state?}
    CheckStuck -->|Yes| RunReconciliation[Run state<br/>reconciliation job]

    PerformanceIssues --> CheckLatency{What's slow?}
    CheckLatency -->|Verification| CheckCache{Caching<br/>enabled?}
    CheckCache -->|No| AddCache[Implement Redis<br/>caching 30s TTL]
    CheckCache -->|Yes| CheckLNDLatency{LND response<br/>time OK?}
    CheckLatency -->|Database| CheckIndexes{Indexes<br/>present?}
    CheckIndexes -->|No| AddIndexes[Add missing<br/>indexes]
    CheckIndexes -->|Yes| CheckPool{Connection pool<br/>exhausted?}
    CheckLatency -->|Memory leak| CheckMemory[Take heap<br/>snapshot]

    RestartNode --> Verify[Verify fix<br/>Test invoice creation]
    FixAmount --> Verify
    AddLiquidity --> Verify
    ManualUpdate --> Verify
    MarkFailed --> Verify
    UpdateSecret --> Verify
    SyncTime --> Verify
    ImplementIdempotency --> Verify
    ResetCircuit --> Verify
    AddCache --> Verify
    AddIndexes --> Verify
    RunReconciliation --> Verify

    Verify --> Success{Issue<br/>resolved?}
    Success -->|Yes| Document[Document root cause<br/>Update runbook]
    Success -->|No| Escalate[Escalate to<br/>on-call engineer]

    Document --> Monitor[Monitor for<br/>recurrence]
    Escalate --> Monitor

    style Start fill:#1e40af,stroke:#3b82f6,color:#fff
    style InvoiceIssues fill:#059669,stroke:#10b981,color:#fff
    style VerificationIssues fill:#059669,stroke:#10b981,color:#fff
    style WebhookIssues fill:#059669,stroke:#10b981,color:#fff
    style RetryIssues fill:#059669,stroke:#10b981,color:#fff
    style StateMachineIssues fill:#059669,stroke:#10b981,color:#fff
    style PerformanceIssues fill:#059669,stroke:#10b981,color:#fff
    style Document fill:#7c3aed,stroke:#8b5cf6,color:#fff
    style Monitor fill:#7c3aed,stroke:#8b5cf6,color:#fff
    style Escalate fill:#dc2626,stroke:#ef4444,color:#fff
